'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
Title = "River Raid";
briefing = "River Raid
Date:  April 27, 1993 - 0700 hours
Location:  Brava Village, Jubba Valley

Situation:
An informant has given us the location of an illegal weapons shipment waiting to be transferred to the Habr Gedir. Your team will insert the target area by Black Hawk. Find and secure the weapons cache and retrieve any intel. Victor Two will be on standby if you need any assistance.
";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>River Raid<-co>
OPORD: 3-93, 10th MTN Div 3    Date Time: 270700 April 93

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>
An informant has identified a village where a large weapon shipment is awaiting transfer to the Habr Gedir.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co> Dry and hot.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co> Village, few permanent structures - Marshlands and river nearby.  U.N. marked minefield southeast of village.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Minimum of twenty Habr Gedir militia equipped with small arms patrolling throughout village. Technicals w/ .50 caliber mounted weapons.
      <cFC8932>Friendly: <-co> None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> 10th Mt, Platoon 3  - Victor Three, Victor Two on Standby
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Insert by Black Hawk, locate and secure arms shipment.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> NLT (No Later Than) 1030 hours.

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Get in and out quickly. Secure arms. Avoid civilian casualties. Secondary objective is to gather intel at the shipment location and report to command.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Move by vehicle along route alpha to drop off. Locate warehouse. Do actions on objective: Secure arms shipment and gather intel. Return by foot to extract vehicles and RTB. 
      <cFC8932>Coordinating instructions: <-co>  1st squad assault and secure weapons. 2nd squad on standby in Black Hawk.


4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  M16/M203, M9 Beretta, AT-4

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
SOP
";

